# "The sacrificed creature" is the one Fling's own additional cost sacrificed (CR 601.2h, 608.2h), not another creature
# sacrificed while Fling is being cast. Bot1 casts Fling at Bot2 sacrificing Hired Blade (3/2) and pays its {1} with Ashnod's
# Altar's mana ability (CR 605.3a, 601.2g), which sacrifices Ornithopter (0/2) as its cost: Bot2 takes 3, not 0. The mana is
# paid before the sacrifice (CR 601.2h lets costs be paid in any order), so Ornithopter is under Hired Blade in the graveyard.

